\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 TEMPLATE VERSION: V1.0.5
\f1\b0 \
This project template shows how to combine Scrivener and the scientific and technical publishing system, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://quarto.org/"}}{\fldrslt Quarto}}. Quarto is basically an opinionated wrapper around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pandoc.org/"}}{\fldrslt Pandoc}}, including templates for multiple outputs alongside numerous filters and extensions. \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

